Package: svora-agent-master
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: bitia <root@alev.pro>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sibatabot/agent-master
Depends: libc6
Description: AgentMaster — owns an agent's processes and their terminals
 Runs an agent's programs, each under a terminal of its own or without one,
 and hands control of them over a port: start one, read its window, type into
 it, resize the window, read its clipboard, pass messages to it and back,
 stop it, ask how it ended.
 .
 Installed as /usr/bin/svora-am. Whoever needs one starts it — the svora
 supervisor starts one per agent — so this package ships no service unit
 and enables nothing.
